- Melos 1, the voice model: made by Singularity Research, and under this project's licence. It contains
  information from the Crowd-sourced Emotional Multimodal Actors Dataset (CREMA-D), which is made available
  under the Open Database License 1.0 (opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1.0).
- From the OpenCV Zoo, each under its own licence there: YuNet face detection (MIT), the facial expression model
